.TH GRID-REPORT 1 "July 2026" "Local Grid Suite v1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grid-report \- Hardware telemetry search, terminal summary, and PDF export CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grid-report
[\fI--limit N\fR] [\fI--date YYYY-MM-DD\fR] [\fI--model MODEL\fR] [\fI--output PATH\fR] [\fI--email RECIPIENT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries historical telemetry runs from the local SQLite database, prints a formatted ASCII summary table to the terminal, and compiles executive-ready PDF performance reports.